## Numerics

INT8 symmetric per-output-channel quantization. Each linear layer:

```
acc[o]   = bias_q[o] + sum_i x[i] * W[o][i]    (signed int32 accumulator)
y_q63[o] = acc[o] * scale_q31[o]               (signed 64-bit product)
y[o]     = y_q63[o] >>> 31                     (arithmetic right shift)
```

Between layers, the int32 output is saturating-clipped to int8 to feed the
next layer. The Python reference applies the same clip.
